{
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.BlindScimitarMiss": "and slashes his scimitars blindly, missing you by a great deal!"
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.FlexibilityFold": "and you use your incredible flexibility to barely fold your body and avoid his attacks!"
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.ScimitarHit": "but you get hit instead!"
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.ScimitarsDodged": "and you successfully dodge his scimitars! "
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.ScimitarsEvaded": "and you successfully dodge his scimitars thanks to your superior evasion! "
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.ScimitarsParried": "and you successfully parry his scimitars! "
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.ScimitarsRaised": "The gatekeeper raises his scimitars "
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarAttack.SlashDodgeAttempt": "and slashes towards you. You attempt to dodge your way out "
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarCrossAttack.BlindCrossMiss": "The blind gatekeeper slashes his scimitars wide, missing you by a great deal!"
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarCrossAttack.CrossSlashWarning": "The gatekeeper raises his scimitars! Judging from the way he is holding, <b>he is going to cross-slash you!</b>"
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarCrossAttack.CrossSlashWound": "The gatekeeper dashes towards you slashes you brutally, carving a massive, 'X' shaped wound on your flesh. You groan in pain, and fall backwards, staggered!"
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.ScimitarCrossAttack.PreparedEvade": "The gatekeeper slashes his scimitar towards you! Thanks to your preparedness, you manage to avoid his scimitars in the nick of time."
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.Won.CutsCollapse": "You collapse, too weak to continue fighting. You are covered in cuts and bruises. The world blacks out. When you wake up, you realize that you are in a random location in the plains. You make your way back to your camp."
  "Scenes.BazaarGatekeeper.Won.LustCollapse": "You collapse from your overwhelming desires and black out. When you wake up, you realize that you are in a random location in the plains. You make your way back to your camp."
}
